# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, keeps secrets and
# host-built artefacts out of the image.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
.vercel

**/*.log
**/uploads
**/.DS_Store

docs
README.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
